  "date-post-text": "24 June 2026",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <blockquote><strong><em>\"When opening a new outlet, we have to ask ourselves a lot of questions: where will the customers be tomorrow?</em></strong></blockquote>\n          <p><em>Thomas Barenfeld, President of the Piadina.</em></p>\n          <p>For this 7th episode of Restaurateurs de demain, we couldn't have asked for a better guest: <strong>Thomas Barenfeld</strong>, General Manager of <strong>Piadina France</strong>, and <strong>Yves Sassi</strong>, President of the <strong>Club de la Franchise</strong>.</p>\n          <p>What do they have in common?</p>\n          <p>A very fine look at the market... and a total absence of tongue-in-cheek! Crisis and recovery, VAT, the digital shift, the big failures of containment, the emergence of new models, the need to adapt, the question of the \"after\" customer... to be very honest, we could have discussed for hours.</p>\n          <p>For the moment, let's go for a good half hour of episode in their company.</p>\n          <figure class=\"w-richtext-align-center\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\":studio_microphone:\" src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f2fcfc59c4a619fe01_1f399-fe0f%402x-1.avif\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:33.75%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-center w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://widget.ausha.co/index.html?chanId=brd64SKN4weM&amp;showId=brpMZCZkNxWJ&amp;color=%23333333&amp;display=horizontal&amp;v=2&amp;height=200px&amp;autonext=1&amp;podcastId=bjQqPs8AkagY\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <h2>Guests of the week</h2>\n          <figure class=\"w-richtext-align-center\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59e8c31a006c_Thomas-Barenfeld.avif\"></div>\n            <figcaption>Thomas Barenfeld and Yves Sassi</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"w-richtext-align-center w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5974b31a00ac_Yves-Sassi.avif\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <h3><strong>Did you like this episode?</strong></h3>\n          <p>Feel free to listen to our other episodes and rate our podcast on your favorite platform!</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1040px\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\"><a href=\"/en/ebook/developper-son-fast-food-le-guide-ultime\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"w-inline-block\">\n              <div><img alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/66b0e3d24a5e372d1a6ee0cd_655f7d9f44ef43bed9fe6995_Banni%25C3%25A8re%2520Blog%2520-%2520guide%2520ultime%2520(1).avif\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            </a></figure>\n        ",
